  "prefLabel": "Env-A 911.01 Purpose",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 911.01 Purpose. The purpose of this part is to establish the recordkeeping and reporting requirements for a facility owner or operator in the event of a permit deviation.\n\nSource. #6983-B, eff 4-23-99; ss by #8872, eff 4-21-07; ss by #10892, eff 7-18-15; ss by #14374, eff 9-20-25, EXPIRES: 9-20-35",
